==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zangief (Enemy)|Zangief]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Chun-Li (Enemy)|Chun-Li]] spawns.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the quite large amount of Doges present in this level, it's advised to bring some quick AOE attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]]. After you finish killing all of the Doges, you can focus on Chun-Li and Zangief. Bring some ranged units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and victory will be yours.

